{"unit_id":"wangjiaxi__dsh-chat-wallpaper#feature-1","repo":"wangjiaxi/dsh-chat-wallpaper","commit":"eb3a9dfc7f0860da8a11d9bd69fff53758053116","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-wallpaper 的功能「上传并应用聊天壁纸」：在设置页选择图片后，插件将其缩放到最长边不超过 1800 像素并重新编码，再绘制到会话正文区域；支持更换和清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:245-297","client.js:539-563","client.js:599-632"]}
{"unit_id":"wangjiaxi__dsh-chat-wallpaper#feature-2","repo":"wangjiaxi/dsh-chat-wallpaper","commit":"eb3a9dfc7f0860da8a11d9bd69fff53758053116","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-wallpaper 的功能「按主题自动校正」：启用自动校正时，插件读取当前背景与正文颜色，结合图片亮度采样计算亮度、对比度和透明度，并在检测到主题颜色变化后重新绘制。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:82-188","client.js:366-393","client.js:738-755"]}
{"unit_id":"wangjiaxi__dsh-chat-wallpaper#feature-3","repo":"wangjiaxi/dsh-chat-wallpaper","commit":"eb3a9dfc7f0860da8a11d9bd69fff53758053116","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-wallpaper 的功能「手动调节并预览」：聊天背景设置页提供透明度、模糊、亮度、对比度和饱和度滑杆，以及示例文字预览和估算对比度读数；关闭自动模式可手动控制参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:565-597","client.js:638-716"]}
{"unit_id":"wangjiaxi__dsh-chat-wallpaper#feature-4","repo":"wangjiaxi/dsh-chat-wallpaper","commit":"eb3a9dfc7f0860da8a11d9bd69fff53758053116","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-wallpaper 的功能「本地保存壁纸状态」：插件把图片和调节参数写入浏览器 localStorage，加载时读取并校正参数，用户可清除背景并恢复默认状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:339-405","client.js:408-445"]}
